{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`SOC`,`title`:`The Lantern Festival`,`titleVN`:`\u0110\u00eam h\u1ed9i tr\u0103ng r\u1eb1m`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Grandma Tu`,`vn`:`b\u00e0 T\u01b0, 78 tu\u1ed5i, l\u00e0m \u0111\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng \u1edf nh\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a s\u1ed1 31, kh\u00e9o tay, m\u00ea truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng`},{`name`:`Ngoc`,`vn`:`Ng\u1ecdc, c\u00f4 b\u00e9 10 tu\u1ed5i \u1edf s\u1ed1 22, t\u00f2 m\u00f2, m\u00ea ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh`},{`name`:`Bin`,`vn`:`em h\u1ecd 8 tu\u1ed5i c\u1ee7a Ng\u1ecdc, r\u1ea5t ngh\u1ecbch`},{`name`:`Tom`,`vn`:`ch\u00e0ng sinh vi\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi Anh 21 tu\u1ed5i, vui t\u00ednh, \u0103n kh\u1ecfe`},{`name`:`Mrs Helen`,`vn`:`b\u00e0 Helen, 52 tu\u1ed5i, m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Tom, t\u1eeb Anh sang th\u0103m con d\u1ecbp Trung thu`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:1,`parts`:1,`title`:`Lanterns for the Moon`,`titleVN`:`\u0110\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00f3n tr\u0103ng`,`words`:`festival|meet|help|culture|together|group|member|party|join|birthday|event|share|present`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[The]] Mid-Autumn [[Festival]] [[is|be]] [[next]] [[week]]. [[Every]] [[afternoon]], [[the]] [[children|child]] [[of]] Lotus Street [[meet]] [[at]] [[number]] 31. Grandma Tu [[makes|make]] lanterns [[there]].`,`vn`:`Tu\u1ea7n sau l\u00e0 T\u1ebft Trung thu. Chi\u1ec1u n\u00e0o tr\u1ebb con ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen c\u0169ng h\u1eb9n nhau \u1edf s\u1ed1 31. B\u00e0 T\u01b0 ng\u1ed3i l\u00e0m \u0111\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng \u1edf \u0111\u00f3.`},{`en`:`Ngoc [[is|be]] [[ten]]. [[She]] [[comes|come]] [[with]] [[her]] [[little]] [[cousin]] Bin [[and]] [[her]] [[friend]] Tin. \`[[Can]] [[we]] [[help]]?\` [[she]] [[asks|ask]]. Grandma Tu [[shows|show]] [[them]] an [[old]] [[star]] lantern. \`Lanterns [[are|be]] [[part]] [[of]] [[our]] [[culture]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]]. \`[[At]] [[the]] [[festival]], [[we]] [[all]] [[walk]] [[together]] [[under]] [[the]] [[moon]].\``,`vn`:`Ng\u1ecdc m\u01b0\u1eddi tu\u1ed5i. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00f9ng c\u1eadu em h\u1ecd Bin v\u00e0 c\u1eadu b\u1ea1n T\u00edn. \`B\u1ecdn ch\u00e1u gi\u00fap b\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng \u1ea1?\` c\u00f4 b\u00e9 h\u1ecfi. B\u00e0 T\u01b0 cho b\u1ecdn tr\u1ebb xem m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n \u00f4ng sao c\u0169. \`\u0110\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. \`\u0110\u00eam h\u1ed9i, c\u1ea3 ph\u1ed1 c\u00f9ng nhau r\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e8n d\u01b0\u1edbi tr\u0103ng.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[children|child]] [[work]] [[together]] [[in]] [[a]] [[group]]. Ngoc [[cuts|cut]] [[the]] [[paper]], [[and]] Tin [[makes|make]] [[the]] [[stars|star]]. Bin [[is|be]] [[a]] [[member]] [[too]]. [[His]] [[job]] [[is|be]] [[to]] [[look]] [[after]] [[the]] [[moon]] [[cakes|cake]] [[for]] [[the]] [[party]]. [[Soon]] [[the]] [[plate]] [[has|have]] [[only]] [[two]] [[cakes|cake]]. \`[[I]] [[am|be]] [[a]] [[good]] [[member]],\` [[says|say]] Bin. \`[[I]] [[test]] [[the]] [[cakes|cake]].\``,`vn`:`B\u1ecdn tr\u1ebb c\u00f9ng nhau l\u00e0m theo nh\u00f3m. Ng\u1ecdc c\u1eaft gi\u1ea5y, T\u00edn l\u00e0m ng\u00f4i sao. Bin c\u0169ng l\u00e0 th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean. Vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu l\u00e0 tr\u00f4ng b\u00e1nh trung thu cho b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c. Ch\u1eb3ng m\u1ea5y ch\u1ed1c, tr\u00ean \u0111\u0129a ch\u1ec9 c\u00f2n hai chi\u1ebfc b\u00e1nh. \`Em l\u00e0 th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean ch\u0103m ch\u1ec9 m\u00e0,\` Bin n\u00f3i. \`Em \u0111ang n\u1ebfm th\u1eed b\u00e1nh gi\u00fap m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi.\``},{`en`:`[[Then]] Tom [[comes|come]] [[in]]. [[He]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[tall]] [[student]] [[from]] England. \`[[Hello]]! [[Can]] [[I]] [[join]] [[you]]?\` Tom [[joins|join]] [[the]] [[group]], [[but]] [[his]] [[big]] [[hands|hand]] [[are|be]] [[slow]]. [[His]] [[star]] [[looks|look]] [[like]] [[a]] [[fish]]. Grandma Tu [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[Good]]. [[We]] [[have]] [[fish]] lanterns [[too]]!\``,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i Tom b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o. Anh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t sinh vi\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi Anh cao l\u1edbn. \`Ch\u00e0o m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi! Cho ch\u00e1u l\u00e0m c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi \u1ea1?\` Tom v\u00e0o nh\u00f3m, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u00f4i tay to c\u1ee7a anh l\u00f3ng ng\u00f3ng. Ng\u00f4i sao c\u1ee7a anh tr\u00f4ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t con c\u00e1. B\u00e0 T\u01b0 b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`T\u1ed1t. M\u00ecnh c\u0169ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u00e8n c\u00e1 ch\u00e9p m\u00e0!\``},{`en`:`Tom [[has|have]] [[news]]. \`[[My]] [[mother]] [[is|be]] [[coming|come]] [[next]] [[Monday]]. [[She]] [[wants|want]] [[to]] [[meet]] [[you]] [[all]]. [[And]] [[festival]] [[night]] [[is|be]] [[her]] [[birthday]]!\` \`[[That]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[big]] [[event]]!\` [[says|say]] Ngoc. Grandma Tu [[has|have]] an [[idea]]. \`[[Then]] [[let's|let]] [[share]] [[our]] [[party]] [[with]] [[her]]. [[And]] [[let's|let]] [[make]] [[her]] [[a]] [[present]]: [[a]] lantern [[like]] [[a]] [[big]] [[moon]].\``,`vn`:`Tom c\u00f3 tin m\u1edbi. \`Th\u1ee9 Hai tu\u1ea7n sau m\u1eb9 ch\u00e1u sang. M\u1eb9 mu\u1ed1n g\u1eb7p m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1eafm. M\u00e0 \u0111\u00eam h\u1ed9i l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00fang sinh nh\u1eadt m\u1eb9 ch\u00e1u!\` \`Th\u1ebf th\u00ec \u0111\u00fang l\u00e0 d\u1ecbp l\u1edbn r\u1ed3i!\` Ng\u1ecdc n\u00f3i. B\u00e0 T\u01b0 n\u1ea3y ra m\u1ed9t \u00fd. \`Th\u1ebf th\u00ec m\u00ecnh m\u1eddi m\u1eb9 ch\u00e1u c\u00f9ng d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c. M\u00ecnh l\u00e0m t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9 ch\u00e1u m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0: m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng tr\u00f2n nh\u01b0 m\u1eb7t tr\u0103ng.\``},{`en`:`[[Everyone]] [[helps|help]]. [[The]] [[moon]] lantern [[is|be]] [[on]] [[the]] [[table]] [[when]] [[the]] [[door]] [[opens|open]]. [[A]] [[small]] [[woman]] [[with]] [[a]] [[big]] [[bag]] [[is|be]] [[there]]. \`[[Hello]], Tom!\` [[It]] [[is|be]] [[his]] [[mother]], [[one]] [[day]] [[early]]. [[And]] [[her]] [[present]] [[is|be]] [[on]] [[the]] [[table]]!`,`vn`:`Ai c\u0169ng x\u1eafn tay v\u00e0o gi\u00fap. Chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n m\u1eb7t tr\u0103ng c\u00f2n \u0111ang n\u1eb1m tr\u00ean b\u00e0n th\u00ec c\u1eeda b\u1eadt m\u1edf. M\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef nh\u1ecf nh\u1eafn x\u00e1ch chi\u1ebfc t\u00fai to \u0111\u1ee9ng \u1edf c\u1eeda. \`Ch\u00e0o Tom!\` L\u00e0 m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a anh, \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1edbm h\u1eb3n m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y. M\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng b\u00e0 th\u00ec \u0111ang n\u1eb1m ngay tr\u00ean b\u00e0n!`}],`tease`:`M\u1eb9 Tom \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1edbm m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y, m\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt v\u1eabn n\u1eb1m ch\u00ecnh \u00ecnh tr\u00ean b\u00e0n!`}]}